{"title":"The Supreme Demon Swordmaster","synopsis":"Sama Geon, yang berhasil menyatukan Sekte Iblis Penembus Langit untuk pertama kalinya dalam tiga ratus tahun, hanya memiliki satu keinginan: untuk hidup biasa bersama keluarganya.\n\nSetelah kembali ke kampung halamannya, ia belajar menjadi tukang daging dan memulai bisnis. Namun, penyakit adik perempuannya memaksa Sama Geon untuk kembali memegang pedang, dan Sekte Iblis Penembus Langit kini mengancam rumahnya.\n\nDemi perdamaian, ia harus mengangkat pedangnya!","alternative_title":"마도제일검","author":"Behwa, Jo Don-Hyung","artist":"Park Gwang-Jin","genres":["Action","Historical","Martial Arts","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"3dda45bd-e420-4946-ab12-b24931701240","number":"44","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"id":"8445a546-0f37-42c9-bed0-3480f5e7c417","number":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"id":"f2497e30-0c75-4696-9c88-ced24014d04e","number":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"4e34bb13-4bc9-44fd-b88e-ac2513adef03","number":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"658af9f3-31ca-4a09-9275-84fffa64e0f5","number":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"4babfb72-3e59-4640-8d41-df6822308898","number":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"b5cbd6bb-ffb0-470d-bf36-a51c9da142da","number":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"id":"7a71def4-a515-482a-b438-02202f65e6cd","number":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"id":"ab2bd6da-6eeb-41cc-b00e-c626ef293c42","number":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"id":"1e861d92-bfc0-4568-be45-62123cc41748","number":"35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-05-31","images":[]},{"id":"f803e5af-a419-42ce-8c48-326347fd8707","number":"34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-05-31","images":[]},{"id":"c7a228b8-7704-4d83-bfa0-ba6701e458eb","number":"33","title":"Chapter 33","d